<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 101,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 101,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual 101,000 and Saturday's 26,000 head at interior Iowa-Minnesota.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than the mid-session Friday.</p>
<p>Several area slaughter plants not killing today. Top $51.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    48.50 -49.50	   49.50 -50.50</p>
<p>few				 50.00		    51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/firm. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -41.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.	   43.00	   44.00 -45.00</p>
